OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASpain announces ban on evictions after
OL,4,Aprotests over 87-year-old woman's
OL,5,Aeviction
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe said the measures would bring
OL,8,Frelief to more than five million people
OL,9,F- but opposition politician Miriam
OL,10,FNogueras said the agreement left "small
OL,11,Flandlords out in the cold".
OL,13,FThe proposals - which have been
OL,14,Fpresented in the form of two decrees -
OL,15,Fcome into effect immediately, but must
OL,16,Fbe approved by Congress within a month,
OL,17,Falthough the government hopes to hold
OL,18,Fthe vote as soon as this Friday.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
